\section{Caveats}{
\itemize{
\item A source name is unique only within a document; across a bulk result key on (source_index, source_name).
\item Age units: a month is 1/12 year, a week 7/365.25, a day 1/365.25, an hour 1/(365.25 x 24).
\item The age column is matched ignoring case, so characteristics[Age] is still read; sdrf validate reports the casing.
\item A conflicting characteristics[age] has no parsed age: the column is withheld.
}
}
\section{Performance}{
Every call starts one bridge process, which costs a .NET start-up before any work. For many files call \code{\link{sdrf_samples_many}()} once rather than looping this function: one process, one start-up, and the thread count stated on the wire.
}
